{"id":"6717c010b885dd29","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-lc-jonsson-cardinal-property.md","title":"ZFC LC Jonsson Cardinal Property","display":"df-zfc-lc-jonsson-cardinal-property — ZFC LC Jonsson Cardinal Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-lc-jonsson-cardinal-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-lc-jonsson-cardinal-property"],"display":"df-zfc-lc-jonsson-cardinal-property — ZFC LC Jonsson Cardinal Property","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-lc-jonsson-cardinal-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-lc-jonsson-cardinal-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-lc-jonsson-cardinal-property — ZFC LC Jonsson Cardinal Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"130f2eb9510d97cd\" href=\"?note=130f2eb9510d97cd\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md\">../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (typed set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcJonssonCardinalProperty}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcJonssonCardinalProperty}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"130f2eb9510d97cd\" href=\"?note=130f2eb9510d97cd\" title=\"58-df-finite-subset.md\">58-df-finite-subset.md</a> 的有限子集记号。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcJonssonCardinalProperty}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\n\\forall F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(F,[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega},\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(|H|=\\kappa\\land F\\bigl[[H]^{&lt;\\omega}\\bigr]\\neq\\kappa\\bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcJonssonCardinalProperty}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\n\\forall F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(F,[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega},\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(|H|=\\kappa\\land F\\bigl[[H]^{&lt;\\omega}\\bigr]\\neq\\kappa\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Quantification is over set-coded functions with the exact finite-subset domain, rather than over an untyped arrow expression.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"